<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Checkout - MiEcommerce</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/style.css">
    <style>
        .checkout-container {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            height: 80vh;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        .checkout-box {
            background: white;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
        }
        .checkout-box h2 {
            color: #2c3e50;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        .btn-group {
            display: flex;
            gap: 15px;
            justify-content: center;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }
        .btn-secondary {
            padding: 10px 20px;
            background-color: #95a5a6;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            transition: background 0.3s;
        }
        .btn-secondary:hover {
            background-color: #7f8c8d;
        }
        .btn-primary {
            padding: 10px 20px;
            background-color: #3498db;
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 5px;
            transition: background 0.3s;
        }
        .btn-primary:hover {
            background-color: #2980b9;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="checkout-container">
        <div class="checkout-box">
            <h2>Checkout disponible en el próximo sprint</h2>
            <p>Estamos trabajando para procesar tus compras de la mejor manera.</p>
            <div class="btn-group">
                <a href="/cart" class="btn-secondary">Volver al carrito</a>
                <a href="/home" class="btn-primary">Volver al inicio</a>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
